 TC01 – Valid Form Submission
Test Case ID: TC01
Title: Verify form submission with valid data

Steps:
1. Open form page
2. Enter valid First Name
3. Enter valid Last Name
4. Enter valid Email
5. Select Gender
6. Enter valid Mobile Number
7. Select Hobbies
8. Enter Current Address
9. Click Submit

Expected Result:
Form should submit successfully and confirmation popup should appear
 TC02 – Invalid Email
Test Case ID: TC02
Title: Verify form with invalid email

Steps:
1. Enter email as "abc123"
2. Fill other fields correctly
3. Click Submit

Expected Result:
System should show error or prevent submission
 TC03 – Blank Required Fields
Test Case ID: TC03
Title: Verify form submission with empty fields

Steps:
1. Do not enter any data
2. Click Submit

Expected Result:
Required field validation messages should appear
 TC04 – Invalid Mobile Number
Test Case ID: TC04
Title: Verify mobile number validation

Steps:
1. Enter mobile number less than 10 digits
2. Click Submit

Expected Result:
Error message should appear for invalid mobile number
TC05 – Boundary Testing (Mobile)
Test Case ID: TC05
Title: Verify mobile number boundary values

Steps:
